#: kplayerengine.cpp:617
msgid "Changes volume level"
msgstr "Luutstärk-Stoop ännern"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:618
msgid ""
"Volume slider shows the current sound volume level and allows you to change "
"it."
msgstr ""
"De Luutstärk-Schuver wiest de opstunns instellte Luutstärk. Du kannst ehr "
"dor ok mit topassen."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:626
msgid "Shows the volume popup slider"
msgstr "Wiest den Luutstärkschuver"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:627
msgid ""
"Volume button displays a slider that shows the current sound volume level "
"and allows you to change it."
msgstr ""
"De Luutstärkknoop wiest en Schuver, mit em kannst Du de Luutstärk topassen."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:640
msgid "&Load Subtitles..."
msgstr "Ünnertiteln &laden"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:642
msgid "Opens a subtitle file"
msgstr "En Ünnertitel-Datei laden"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:643
msgid ""
"Load Subtitles command displays the standard Open File dialog and lets you "
"choose a subtitle file to use with the current file or URL. If you load "
"subtitles when video is playing, KPlayer will display the subtitles "
"immediately. By default it will also remember the subtitles you choose in "
"the current file properties. This command is available for video files."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Ünnertiteln laden\" maakt den normalen \"Datei opmaken\"-Dialoog "
"op. Dor kannst Du denn de Ünnertiteldatei mit utsöken, de Du för de aktuelle "
"Datei oder URL bruken wullt. Laadst Du Ünnertiteln, bides en Video afspeelt "
"warrt, wiest KPlayer de Ünnertiteln fuurts. Standardwies wohrt dat ok de "
"Ünnertiteln, de Du binnen de aktuelle Dateiegenschappen utsöchst. Disse "
"Befehl is bi Videodateien verföögbor."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:648
msgid "&Full Screen"
msgstr "&Heelschirm"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:651
msgid "Switches to full screen mode"
msgstr "Na Heelschirm-Bedrief wesseln"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:652
msgid ""
"Full Screen command switches to full screen video display and back to normal "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Heelschirm\" wiest dat Video op den helen Schirm oder wedder "
"normaal."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:656
msgid "Enlarges the video"
msgstr "Maakt dat Bild grötter"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:657
msgid ""
"Zoom In command enlarges the video area by one half of the original video "
"size of the current file."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Grötter maken\" maakt dat Wiesrebeet üm den Halfdeel vun de "
"aktuelle Datei ehr Orginaalgrött grötter."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:661
msgid "Shrinks the video"
msgstr "Maakt dat Bild lütter"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:662
msgid ""
"Zoom Out command reduces the video area by one half of the original video "
"size of the current file."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Lütter maken\" maakt dat Wiesrebeet üm den Halfdeel vun de "
"aktuelle Datei ehr Orginaalgrött lütter."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:670
msgid "Zoom to 5&0%"
msgstr "Grött op 5&0%"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:672
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scales video to 50% of the original size"
msgstr "Passt dat Video op den Halfdeel vun sien Orginaalgrött to."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:674
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Zoom to 50% command resizes the video area to one half of the original video "
"size of the current file."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Grött op 50%\" sett dat Wiesrebeet sien Grött op den Halfdeel "
"vun dat Video sien Orginaalgrött."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:679
msgid "Zoom to &100%"
msgstr "Grött op &100%"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:681
msgid "Scales video to its original size"
msgstr "Passt dat Video op sien Orginaalgrött to."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:683
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Zoom to 100% command resizes the video area to the original video size of "
"the current file."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Grött op 100%\" sett dat Wiesrebeet sien Grött op dat Video sien "
"Orginaalgrött."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:688
msgid "Zoo&m to 150%"
msgstr "G&rött op 150%"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:690
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scales video to 150% of the original size"
msgstr "Passt dat Video op 150% vun de Orginaalgrött to."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:692
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Zoom to 150% command resizes the video area to 150% of the original video "
"size of the current file."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Grött op 150%\" sett dat Wiesrebeet sien Grött op 150% vun dat "
