msgid ""
"Rename command starts edit mode for the current item in the multimedia "
"library so you can change the item name."
msgstr ""
"Mit den Befehl \"Ümnömen\" kannst Du dat aktuelle Stück binnen de Multimedia-"
"Bibliotheek ümnömen."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3358
msgid "Propert&ies..."
msgstr "&Egenschappen..."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3359
msgid "Opens Properties dialog for the selected item"
msgstr "Egenschappen-Dialoog för utsöcht Stück opmaken"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3360
msgid ""
"Properties command opens File Properties dialog for the current item in the "
"multimedia library. See the File properties micro-HOWTO for details."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Egenschappen\" maakt den Dialoog \"Dateiegenschappen\" för dat "
"aktuelle Stück binnen de Multimedia-Bibliotheek op. Kiek Di de \"Kortanleden "
"Datei-Egenschappen\" an, wenn Du mehr weten wullt."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3365
msgid "Selects all items in the current folder"
msgstr "All Stücken binnen den aktuellen Orner utsöken"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3366
msgid ""
"Select all command selects all items in the current folder of the multimedia "
"library."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"All utsöken\" söcht all Dateien binnen den aktuellen Orner vun "
"de Multimedia-Bibliotheek ut."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3372
msgid "Moves the selected items up in the playlist"
msgstr "De utsöchten Stücken op de Afspeellist na baven verschuven"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3373
msgid ""
"Move Up command moves the selected items up in a playlist. You can also move "
"items around by clicking and dragging them with the left mouse button."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Na baven\" verschufft de utsöchten Stücken op de Afspeellist na "
"baven. Du kannst Stücken ok mit den linken Muusknoop anklicken un na en "
"anner Steed trecken."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3379
msgid "Moves the selected items down in the playlist"
msgstr "De utsöchten Stücken op de Afspeellist na nerrn verschuven"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3380
msgid ""
"Move Down command moves the selected items down in a playlist. You can also "
"move items around by clicking and dragging them with the left mouse button."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Na nerrn\" schufft de utsöchten Stücken op de Afspeellist daal. "
"Du kannst Stücken ok mit den linken Muusknoop anklicken un na en anner Steed "
"trecken."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3384
msgid "Re&move"
msgstr "&Wegmaken"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3387
msgid "Removes the selected items from the multimedia library"
msgstr "Utsöcht Stücken ut Multimedia-Bibliotheek wegmaken"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3388
msgid "Remove command removes the selected items from the multimedia library."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Wegmaken\" maakt de utsöchten Stücken ut de Multimedia-"
"Bibliotheek weg."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3389 kplayernodeview.cpp:3461
#, kde-format
msgid "Opens %1 in the library window"
msgstr "Maakt \"%1\" binnen dat Bibliotheekfinster op"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3390 kplayernodeview.cpp:3462
#, kde-format
msgid "Go to %1 command opens the corresponding folder in the library window."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Na '%1' gahn\" maakt den tohören Orner binnen dat "
"Bibliotheekfinster op."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3395
msgid "&Back"
msgstr "&Torüch"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3398
msgid "Opens the previous folder"
msgstr "Verleden Orner opmaken"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3399
msgid "Go back command opens the previous folder from the history."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Torüch gahn\" maakt den verleden Orner ut de Vörgeschicht op."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3406
msgid "Opens the next folder"
msgstr "Nakamen Orner opmaken"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3407
msgid "Go forward command opens the next folder from the history."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Vörut gahn\" maakt den nakamen Orner ut de Vörgeschicht op."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3411
msgid "&Up"
msgstr "Na &baven"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3414
msgid "Opens the parent folder"
msgstr "Överornt Orner opmaken"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3415
msgid "Go up command opens the parent folder of the current folder."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Na baven gahn\" maakt den överornt Orner op."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3419
msgid "&Down"
msgstr "Na &nerrn"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3422
msgid "Opens the selected folder"
msgstr "Utsöcht Orner opmaken"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3423
msgid "Go down command opens the selected folder."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Na nerrn gahn\" maakt den utsöchten Orner op."

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3427
msgid "&To Origin"
msgstr "Na Oorsprung"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3429
msgid "Opens the origin of the current folder"
msgstr "Den Oorsprung vun den aktuellen Orner opmaken"

#: kplayernodeview.cpp:3430
msgid "Go to origin command opens the origin folder of the current folder."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Na Oorsprung gahn\" maakt den Oorsprung vun den aktuellen Orner "
"op."

